# A range-delete walk stamped with no open tree-fence intent: a replicated or
# shadow-forwarded range delete, or a fan-out that began before the gate opened,
# reaches a shard root through an existing method that stamps it anyway. No
# marker holds L, so its armed leaf passes the record.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestRangeDeleteWithoutIntent
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a range-delete walk is stamped although no tree-fence intent is open
PERTURBS: GAdmit
BOUNDS: WithTreeWalk = TRUE, WithBatch = FALSE, MaxWindows = 1

--- FIND
    /\ phase = "live"
    /\ hoOpen
    /\ ~closing
    /\ gst = "idle"
--- REPLACE
    /\ phase = "live"
\* MUTATION: stamped without an open intent; it should be appended unstamped.
    /\ gst = "idle"
--- END